{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"34":"Clothing (Kitab Al-Libas)"},"section_detail":{"34":{"hadithnumber_first":4020,"hadithnumber_last":4158,"arabicnumber_first":4020,"arabicnumber_last":4158,"name_native":"كتاب اللباس"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4121,"arabicnumber":4121,"text":"حدثنا مسدد، حدثنا يزيد، حدثنا معمر، عن الزهري، بهذا الحديث لم يذكر ميمونة قال فقال \" الا انتفعتم باهابها \" . ثم ذكر معناه لم يذكر الدباغ","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (1492) Sahih Muslim (363)"}],"reference":{"book":34,"hadith":102}}]}